cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ICS / OT / SCADA PCAP Challenges"
message: >-
  If you use this challenge range, cite it AND the original dataset authors listed under
  references (several CC BY licenses require it). Full credits: ATTRIBUTION.md.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: SackOfHacks
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/SackOfHacks/ICS-PCAP-Challenges"
url: "https://sackofhacks.github.io/ICS-PCAP-Challenges/"
keywords:
  - ICS
  - OT
  - SCADA
  - industrial control systems
  - pcap
  - network forensics
  - threat hunting
  - CTF
  - Pcapper
